cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "canopies: augmented canopies for 1-parameter fibered filtrations"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Paluzo-Hidalgo"
    given-names: "Eduardo"
    email: "epaluzo@us.es"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4280-5945"
abstract: >-
  Exact detection of non-Hausdorff (structural) points and computation of
  trajectories for 1-parameter fibered filtration functions. An independent
  implementation building on the canopies of Giunti and Munch and the
  linear-time vineyard updates of Cohen-Steiner, Edelsbrunner and Morozov;
  it is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced in collaboration with
  the authors of those works. All core arithmetic is exact rational
  arithmetic.
keywords:
  - topological data analysis
  - persistent homology
  - vineyards
  - canopies
  - fibered filtration
  - computational topology
license: MIT
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EduPH/Canopies"
